<section class="wrap page">
  <p class="kicker">FAQs & planning tools</p>
  <h1>What business owners usually want to know first.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Better questions lead to better retirement decisions. Use the estimate as a conversation starter, then bring your actual facts to a Sterling consultant for a more grounded view.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn outline" href="/calculator">Open contribution estimate</a></div>
